  "ID_MAILBOX_CANDY_1795713839283_LVEN90KD3YH_TITLE": "Content Update 1 celebration!",
  "ID_MAILBOX_CANDY_1795713839283_LVEN90KD3YH_BODY": "The first content update! \nEnjoy the new plants and zombies! \nHere's an celebration reward! <D",
  "ID_MAILBOX_CANDY_1795715573417_TVASI9M6YZ_TITLE": "Dirt Sheet Update",
  "ID_MAILBOX_CANDY_1795715573417_TVASI9M6YZ_BODY": "Key Lye Pie And Tire Zombie Are coming soon! Stay Tuned! \nThe date will be revealed later or Sprout will confirm it! - Pvz3+ Team",
  "ID_MAILBOX_CANDY_1795717425444_Y9FHK7RSD9Q_TITLE": "PvZ3+ — The Road to Version 1.0!",
  "ID_MAILBOX_CANDY_1795717425444_Y9FHK7RSD9Q_BODY": "The beta era is coming to an end, and we're getting ready for the biggest milestone in PvZ3+ history!\n\nOn December 22, 2026, at 22:00 GMT, the Sewer Expansion Update will officially mark the end of Beta and the beginning of our Release Candidate (RC) phase!\n\nWhat's next?\n\n- December 22 — RC 1: Sewer Expansion Update\n- December 27 — RC 2: Thunder Choy Update\n- January 12 — RC 3: Cowbell Update\n- February 5 — Version 1.0: THE BIG UPDATE!\n\n🎉 The Big Update\n\nLaunching on February 5, 2027, at 17:00 GMT, The Big Update will mark the official full release of PvZ3+!\n\nGet ready for:\n\n- 16 announced new plants!\n- 4 announced new zombies!\n- Brand-new fusion combinations!\n- Familiar faces returning to the lawn!\n- The introduction of Sneak Stalk, a custom plant!\n- And potentially even more surprises!\n\n🎁 A special thank-you!\n\nTo celebrate the official launch, every player who joined PvZ3+ before Version 1.0 will receive a special reward when The Big Update releases!\n\nThis is our way of thanking everyone who has supported, played and been part of PvZ3+ throughout its development.\n\nWhat is the reward? Well... that would ruin the surprise, wouldn't it? ;)\n\nThank you for being part of this journey. We're only getting started!\n\nStay tuned for more Dirt Sheet teasers and announcements!\n\n— The PvZ3+ Team",
  "ID_MAILBOX_CANDY_1795719226480_9Z70E1T3K7P_TITLE": "Happy New Year!",
  "ID_MAILBOX_CANDY_1795719226480_9Z70E1T3K7P_BODY": "An entire year of PvZ3 Plus! Amazing! \nHere's an prize for sticking with us\nSee you later! <3 \n- PvZ3+ Team",
  "ID_MAILBOX_CANDY_1795721451968_LW5N2384V9_TITLE": "Merry Christmas",
  "ID_MAILBOX_CANDY_1795721451968_LW5N2384V9_BODY": "Wow! Christmas! Did you get good presents? \nHere's an present from us! <D\nPvZ3+ Team!",
  "ID_MAILBOX_CANDY_1795729543594_UHF22H5J6_TITLE": "Happy Thanksgiving!",
  "ID_MAILBOX_CANDY_1795729543594_UHF22H5J6_BODY": "Stay Tuned! An new tier 1 T2 and T3 are coming! Their limited so get online!\nAlso enjoy your thanksgiving if you celebrate it! Pvz3+ Team",
